@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@conversationId = REEMPLAZA_CONVERSATION_ID

### List inquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries

### Inquiry detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries/INQUIRY_ID

### Update inquiry status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries/INQUIRY_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "QUALIFIED"
}

### Update inquiry notes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiries/INQUIRY_ID/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Cliente con urgencia alta y necesidad en estrategia fiscal"
}

### 1. List conversations and copy the conversation id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations

### 2. Conversation detail before taking control
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### 3. Take human control
# Expected: 200 and data.stage = "PENDING_HUMAN"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/take-control

### 4. Verify human control is active
# Expected: stage = "PENDING_HUMAN"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### 5. Send a message as a human operator
# This sends a real WhatsApp message to the conversation contact.
# Expected: 201, direction = "OUT"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hola, soy parte del equipo de Conta Magno. Tomé el control de esta conversación para ayudarte personalmente."
}

### 6. Verify the outgoing message was persisted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### 7. Release human control
# Expected: 200 and data.stage = "COMPLETED" for a closed inquiry, otherwise "QUALIFYING"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/release-control

### 8. Verify assistant control is active again
# Expected: stage = "COMPLETED" for a closed inquiry, otherwise "QUALIFYING"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### 9. Verify sending without human control is rejected
# Expected: 400, "You must take control first"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Este mensaje no debe enviarse."
}

### 10. Validate an empty message
# Expected: 400, "text es obligatorio"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}

### 11. Respuestas después de completar el inquiry
# Completa un flujo mediante el webhook del proveedor y copia su conversationId.
# Envía otra duda con un providerMessageId nuevo: debe responder sin crear otro
# inquiry ni repetir OWNER_LEAD_TEMPLATE_SENT. Toma/libera control y repite:
# release-control debe conservar COMPLETED. Revisa los mensajes en el panel.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}
